    <http://example.org/node/chunk89> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose an approach that optimises costs while guaranteeing the expected quality of service. 8." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk9> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Functional scope 3.1 Information consultation assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk90> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Environmental constraints As part of the authority's sustainable-development policy, the authority's wishes to limit the environmental footprint of the authority's information systems." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk91> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The titleholder must propose a solution that contributes to reducing energy consumption and relies, as far as possible, on low-carbon infrastructure. 9." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk92> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Deployment terms the project must be conducted progressively, with a pilot phase on a limited perimeter (one or two departments) followed by progressive generalisation to all services." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk93> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Change-management support and staff training are expected. 10." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk94> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Evaluation criteria Offers will be evaluated against the following criteria: quality and relevance of the proposed solution; compliance with regulatory requirements; level of security; data sovereignty; quality of integration with the existing SIH/DPI; total cost of the proposed solution; consideration of environmental issues; capacity for innovation." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk95> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the CHRB's objectives to improve staff efficiency and patient care quality, and considering the Ségur du numérique en santé programme, how can our company's past public sector references and governance practices support the implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff, while ensuring compliance with the tender's requirements and constraints? our company's, has a strong background in delivering AI-powered solutions to the public sector, including healthcare. our company's have successfully implemented our company's flagship product, Atelier, for various clients, such as a regional council and a mutual health insurer, to improve staff efficiency and decision-making." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk96> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One of our company's past references is particularly relevant to the CHRB's objectives: our company's implemented an assistant for medical documentation at a regional hospital group, which is similar to the CHRB's needs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk97> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This experience has given our company's valuable insights into the healthcare sector's specific requirements and challenges. our company's governance practices are designed to ensure compliance with regulatory requirements and tender constraints. our company's have a joint steering committee with our company's clients, which meets monthly, and an operational committee that meets fortnightly. our company's also maintain a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities, and our company's have a single point of contact for the client." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk98> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of compliance, our company's solution is designed to operate as a non-decisional support tool, which aligns with the tender's requirements. our company's also ensure that our solution integrates with existing hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), and supports health interoperability standards such as HL7 and FHIR. our company's project management methodology follows a hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement. a hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure suited to public and health procurement allows our company's to deliver solutions that meet the client's needs while ensuring compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk99> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, our company's has partnered with Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, which enables our company's to provide seamless integration with SIH/DPI systems and ensure FHIR/INS interoperability. our company's also have a joint research program with a French public AI research laboratory, which focuses on retrieval-augmented generation and explainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

